       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MOVECORR.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-GROUP1.
           05 WS-EMP-ID PIC 9(5).
           05 WS-EMP-NAME PIC X(20).
           05 WS-DEPT PIC X(10).
       01 WS-GROUP2.
           05 WS-EMP-ID PIC 9(5).
           05 WS-EMP-NAME PIC X(20).
           05 WS-DEPT PIC X(10).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 10001 TO WS-EMP-ID OF WS-GROUP1.
           MOVE 'JOHN DOE' TO WS-EMP-NAME OF WS-GROUP1.
           MOVE 'SALES' TO WS-DEPT OF WS-GROUP1.

           MOVE CORRESPONDING WS-GROUP1 TO WS-GROUP2.

           DISPLAY WS-EMP-ID OF WS-GROUP2.
           DISPLAY WS-EMP-NAME OF WS-GROUP2.
           DISPLAY WS-DEPT OF WS-GROUP2.
           STOP RUN.
